        "# Dictionary\n",
        "\n",
        "A dictionary is a mutable mapping from hashable keys to values. For example, `{\"name\": \"Ada\"}` maps the key `\"name\"` to `\"Ada\"`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-dictionary)"
      ]
    }
